    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 15, marginTop: 16 }}>
      {[
        'ChEMBL snapshot: publication bias towards potent compounds; assay conditions inconsistent across ~30 papers.',
        'Ligand-based only &mdash; no docking or protein-structure information; physicochemical coincidence cannot be excluded.',
        'The generative scorer is the same model whose failure modes are documented; pFAP &gt; 9 means "inside the confident region", not "10 nM".',
        'Similarity gate at 0.40 constrains novelty by construction.',
      ].map((t, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>&bull;</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, width: 520 }}>{t}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 100, left: 664, width: 556, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>Next steps</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 15, marginTop: 16 }}>
      {[
        'Centralised, consistent assay campaign for a few hundred FAP inhibitors &mdash; the cheapest way to lower the error floor.',
        'Structure-aware features (docking poses, protein contacts) to separate sub-pocket match from coincidence.',
        'Prospective time-split validation: freeze the model, score everything published in the next 12 months.',
        'Dual-objective active learning: let the selectivity assay, not the model, decide which generated scaffold is synthesised.',
      ].map((t, i) => (
        <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>&bull;</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.45, width: 520 }}>{t}</Text>
        </Box>
      ))}
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 672, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row' }}>
